      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "II — Time",
      "estimated_duration_s": 28,
      "narration_text": "Two facts about time came first. In my Airflow version, a scheduled run's data interval has zero length, so fetching the interval would fetch nothing. And arXiv only shows a paper once it's announced. A paper submitted on Friday afternoon is announced on Monday evening. A run that fetches yesterday misses it, forever.",
