      "beat_id": "B08",
      "act": "IV — Honesty",
      "estimated_duration_s": 27,
      "narration_text": "But that creates a trap. Airflow marks a run green if its last tasks succeeded. A report that always runs, and always succeeds, would turn a failed run green. So the report reads every task's result. A task only returns a value if it succeeded. If any value is missing, the report logs everything, then raises.",
